- exportInvoicePdfDirect renders directly; the stamp dialog is moot since the
  commercial invoice never prints the stamp (proforma keeps its dialog).
- Remove leftover implicit global contractSourceLabel + unused cVal.
- test_doc3.js: spec terbilang/receipt/inclusive-PO cases + template scan (28 PASS).
- QUEUE.md: restore the DOC-2 line DOC-3 overwrote; DOC-3 as its own item.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
